<section class="section page-hero"><div class="page-width"><p class="eyebrow">About Valurée</p><h1>Built for the moments<br><span class="gradient-text">that bring you back together.</span></h1><p>Valurée began with a simple truth: couples want meaningful time together, but planning it can feel like work.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="page-width story-grid"><article><h2>Our purpose</h2><p>We’re building a private, premium space where both partners can be honest about what they need and discover dates that respect both people.</p></article><article><h2>What we believe</h2><p>Connection grows through small intentional moments. Technology should make those moments easier to create—not replace them.</p></article><article><h2>What Valurée is not</h2><p>Valurée is recreational date planning. It is not therapy, diagnosis, medical advice, or professional relationship counseling.</p></article></div></section>
